k! Not that I hang out there or anything. Your place is still my numero uno.","speakerId":"Ntt_BD75DC29","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That’s mine! Gotta love PoccoCup. That Bou can sure make a drink! Not that I hang out there or anything. Your place is still my numero uno.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2475.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41431","byteOffset":30001936,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_5D71F189","articyId":"72057611217997613","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cale Wyer","text":"Really? You mean it? Only I don’t wanna take up a chair for too long, not when you got important customers, you know? You’re probably sick of my face already, haha!","speakerId":"Ntt_BD75DC29","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Really? You mean it? Only I don’t wanna take up a chair for too long, not when you got important customers, you know? You’re probably sick of my face already, haha!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3075.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40862","byteOffset":29785312,"byteLength":512}},{"id":"DFr_17CA64CB","articyId":"72057611217997644","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cale Wyer","text":"Oh sure, sure! I get that. Hey, thanks so much for this coffee. It’s gonna be the best one yet, I know it.","speakerId":"Ntt_BD75DC29","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh sure, sure! I get that. Hey, thanks so much for this coffee. It’s gonna be the best one yet, I know it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3950.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","path